{#
    Item Detail Back Button -- link from an item detail page back to that type's list.

    Renders the small button every item detail page carries on its title row, right-aligned. A
    visitor arriving from a search result, a shared link or a tag badge has no list page in their
    history, so the way back has to be on the page rather than in the browser's back button. The
    caller supplies the list URL; label and icon are shared so all item types read the same.

    Used in:    dishes / books / films / glossary detail pages
    Parameters:
        - url (string, required) -- path of the item type's list page
#}
<a href="{{ url }}" class="button is-small is-light">
    <span class="icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i></span>
    <span>{{ 'global.button_back'|trans }}</span>
</a>
